DATA LICENSING — DamLevels-Data

Three licences apply, depending on the file. In every case keep the source
attribution in section 1.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Source values (DGBGTH bulletins published by ONAGRI)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The daily bulletins "Situation des barrages" are produced by the Direction
Générale des Barrages et des Grands Travaux Hydrauliques (DGBGTH), Ministère
de l'Agriculture, des Ressources Hydrauliques et de la Pêche, and published by
the Observatoire National de l'Agriculture (ONAGRI):
https://www.onagri.nat.tn/Situation-des-barrages/fr/19

The values are reused under the Licence Nationale de Données Publiques
Ouvertes (Décret gouvernemental n° 2021-3 du 6 janvier 2021 relatif aux
données publiques ouvertes), the licence under which ONAGRI publishes its open
data (https://catalog.agridata.tn). The bulletin page itself does not state a
licence; this repository relies on the national licence as the default for
ONAGRI open data. It permits reuse, redistribution and adaptation, including
commercial use, provided the data producer and the date of the data are
referenced.

Required attribution:

  Source: DGBGTH, Ministère de l'Agriculture, des Ressources Hydrauliques et
  de la Pêche (Tunisie), bulletins "Situation des barrages" published by
  ONAGRI, 2014-07-02 to 2025-10-10. Licence Nationale de Données Publiques
  Ouvertes. Extracted and restructured by DamLevels-Data.

The two sample bulletins in sources/samples/ are redistributed under the same
licence. All other bulletins are available from ONAGRI; sources/manifest.csv
gives the original_url of each.

